          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " and Black two knights, and the white pawn on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d4"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " is "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "isolated-pawn",
            "text": "isolated"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". Each difference calls for a plan: the bishops want an open game, and the knights want the square in front of the isolated pawn. No plan is good for every position: it comes from these differences."
          }
        ]
      },
